  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">* 생각보다 선생님들께서 많이 활동지를 기다려주셔서 친구에게 내용을 전달했더니, 도서 증정 이벤트까지 가져왔더라구요..</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">무언가 홍보가 들어가면 안될 것 같아 친구에게도 잠시 기다려달라고도 해보고, 카페지기 선생님께 문의를 드리려 했는데 연락할 수 있는 방도를 찾지 못해 댓글로 문의를 드렸습니다만,, 답장이 없어서 ㅠㅠ 일단은 게시해봅니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">혹시 문제가 되면 꼭 말씀 부탁드립니다!! 아래는 친구가 쓴 글입니다 ( _ _ ) 꾸벅</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">--------------------------------------------------------<br>안녕하세요!&#160;출판사&#160;시공사&#160;마케터입니다. <br>&#160; <br>랜들&#160;먼로의&#160;위험한&#160;과학책&#160;시리즈&#160;신간&#160;&lt;아주&#160;위험한&#160;과학책&gt;&#160;출간&#160;기념으로&#160;마케터이지만&#160;과학&#160;독후&#160;활동지를&#160;열심히&#160;만들어보았는데요..!&#160;활동지를&#160;만들면서&#160;오랜만에&#160;과학&#160;공부를&#160;해보았답니다ㅎㅎ&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">선생님의&#160;시선에서&#160;활동지를&#160;보면&#160;부족한&#160;점들이&#160;많겠지만,&#160;학생들이&#160;과학에&#160;흥미를&#160;갖게&#160;하고&#160;<b>&lt;아주&#160;위험한&#160;과학책&gt;</b>을&#160;더&#160;재미있게&#160;읽을&#160;수&#160;있으면&#160;좋겠다는&#160;마음으로&#160;만들었어요.&#160;책&#160;속에&#160;담긴&#160;다양한&#160;기상천외한&#160;질문들에&#160;대해&#160;상상해보고&#160;관련된&#160;과학적&#160;원리를&#160;익힐&#160;수&#160;있도록&#160;각&#160;주제당&#160;4페이지&#160;정도의&#160;분량이에요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8db8b779decb5d0061f618d06a9db84db386ea37?download\" data-file-name=\"아주 위험한 과학 서포터즈 1주차 활동지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"4072068\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20230504171947&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F8db8b779decb5d0061f618d06a9db84db386ea37')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">아주 위험한 과학 서포터즈 1주차 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.88MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ab6261729d0cf8e7646e2f1d019888b42024b86?download\" data-file-name=\"아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 2주차 활동지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"6291148\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20230504171947&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2ab6261729d0cf8e7646e2f1d019888b42024b86')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 2주차 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">6.00MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/699eb9cc3fd20abd3d3349efb625ce066d5b371f?download\" data-file-name=\"아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 3주차 활동지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"5342963\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20230504171947&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F699eb9cc3fd20abd3d3349efb625ce066d5b371f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 3주차 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">5.10MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5b2b10b23a40b5844a17a5f07ce170f37161fd1?download\" data-file-name=\"아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 4주차 활동지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2543514\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20230504171947&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd5b2b10b23a40b5844a17a5f07ce170f37161fd1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">아주 위험한 과학서포터즈 4주차 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.43MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">영재교육원&#160;학생들을&#160;대상으로&#160;활동지를&#160;받아보았었는데&#160;다양한&#160;답변이&#160;나와&#160;재미있고&#160;신기하기도&#160;하더라고요!&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">위험한&#160;과학책&#160;시리즈는&#160;학생들이&#160;좋아한다는&#160;평들이&#160;많아서&#160;활동지도&#160;다양하게&#160;활용해주셨으면&#160;좋겠습니다:) <br><br>그리고&#160;재미있는&#160;과학&#160;수업&#160;만들기의&#160;과학&#160;선생님을&#160;대상으로&#160;도서&#160;증정&#160;이벤트를&#160;진행하고&#160;싶은데요!&#160;아래&#160;폼을&#160;제출해주신&#160;분들&#160;중&#160;30분을&#160;선정하여&#160;도서를&#160;보내드리겠습니다.&#160;많은&#160;관심&#160;부탁드립니다&#9829; <br><br>참여&#160;링크&#160;▶&#160;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/42mNdez\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">bit.ly/42mNdez</a> <br><br>*이은재&#160;선생님께&#160;해당&#160;게시글&#160;업로드를&#160;부탁드렸습니다.&#160;선생님들의&#160;커뮤니티에&#160;광고글로&#160;생각하실&#160;수&#160;있을&#160;것&#160;같아&#160;걱정이&#160;되는데요..!&#160;문제가&#160;있을&#160;시&#160;바로&#160;게시글은&#160;삭제하도록&#160;하겠습니다!&#160;감사합니다.&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
